0c9e27c6a56a63faf3f4a27\"},\"P0178\":{\"source_handle\":\"P0178\",\"source_id\":\"source::P0178\",\"aliases\":[],\"title\":\"The gut microbiome as an actionable drug-sensitivity modulator for immune checkpoint blockade: clinical evidence for FMT, live biotherapeutics, and defined consortia\",\"doi\":\"10.3389/fimmu.2026.1802676\",\"paper_id\":\"4e5d3c59029be0d184837900411ff5a84badd8bc\"},\"P0304\":{\"source_handle\":\"P0304\",\"source_id\":\"source::P0304\",\"aliases\":[],\"title\":\"Impact of gut-microbiome altering drugs and fecal microbiota transplant on the efficacy and toxicity of immune checkpoint inhibitors: A systematic review\",\"doi\":\"10.1016/j.adcanc.2021.100020\",\"paper_id\":\"84b1e34896b604ec02c721d50caa6d49e2965297\"},\"P0358\":{\"source_handle\":\"P0358\",\"source_id\":\"source::P0358\",\"aliases\":[],\"title\":\"The role of gut microbiome in modulating response to immune checkpoint inhibitor therapy in cancer\",\"doi\":\"10.21037/atm-20-6427\",\"paper_id\":\"9c8304850055dda9ff76ba5868edb8fbfe85773b\"},\"P0474\":{\"source_handle\":\"P0474\",\"source_id\":\"source::P0474\",\"aliases\":[],\"title\":\"Tumor microenvironment-mediated resistance to immune checkpoint inhibitors in non-small cell lung cancer: Mechanisms, combination strategies and clinical perspectives (Review)\",\"doi\":\"10.3892/mco.2026.2971\",\"paper_id\":\"d227bde3dc62e02cfe87a58fa5173e149048ed4e\"},\"P0594\":{\"source_handle\":\"P0594\",\"source_id\":\"source::P0594\",\"aliases\":[],\"title\":\"Targeting the gut microbiota-metabolite-immune axis in cancer immunotherapy: mechanistic interplay, therapeutic strategies, and translational applications-a narrative review\",\"doi\":\"10.21037/tcr-2025-1992\",\"paper_id\":\"CorpusId:286927958\"},\"P0006\":{\"source_handle\":\"P0006\",\"source_id\":\"source::P0006\",\"aliases\":[],\"title\":\"77 Impact of CBM588 on gut microbiome composition and dysbiosis in patients receiving frontline immune checkpoint inhibitor (ICI) combinations for metastatic renal cell carcinoma (mRCC)\",\"doi\":\"10.1093/oncolo/oyae181.007\",\"paper_id\":\"00f9287693a34900251aaeb6413aa11954a22877\"},\"P0143\":{\"source_handle\":\"P0143\",\"source_id\":\"source::P0143\",\"aliases\":[],\"title\":\"Impact of CBM588 on gut microbiome composition and dysbiosis in patients receiving frontline immune checkpoint inhibitor (ICI) combinations for metastatic renal cell carcinoma (mRCC).\",\"doi\":\"10.1200/jco.2024.42.16_suppl.4550\",\"paper_id\":\"40bb0c781682f60135b3050a5dd92d2659017944\"},\"P0125\":{\"source_handle\":\"P0125\",\"source_id\":\"source::P0125\",\"aliases\":[],\"title\":\"376 A phase I/II study of live biotherapeutic MRx0518 in combination with pembrolizumab in patients refractory to immune checkpoint inhibitors\",\"doi\":\"10.1136/jitc-2020-sitc2020.0376\",\"paper_id\":\"3681bf55ee7a54db3e29efef26cafae311f70b3b\"},\"P0230\":{\"source_handle\":\"P0230\",\"source_id\":\"source::P0230\",\"aliases\":[],\"title\":\"283 Safety and efficacy signals in the complete phase I study of live biotherapeutic MRx0518 in combination with pembrolizumab in patients refractory to immune checkpoint inhibitors (ICIs)\",\"doi\":\"10.1136/jitc-2020-sitc2020.0283\",\"paper_id\":\"5fcfc7e86cad682e895618b68f0561fb4f0a1738\"},\"P0244\":{\"source_handle\":\"P0244\",\"source_id\":\"source::P0244\",\"aliases\":[],\"title\":\"805 Safety and emerging evidence of immune modulation of the live biotherapeutic MRx0518 in the neoadjuvant setting for patients awaiting surgical removal of solid tumours\",\"doi\":\"10.1136/jitc-2020-sitc2020.0805\",\"paper_id\":\"6616c4ad828cc2fd463ceba12acdf8d1aad10caf\"},\"P0251\":{\"source_handle\":\"P0251\",\"source_id\":\"source::P0251\",\"aliases\":[],\"title\":\"Microbial mechanisms to improve immune checkpoint blockade responsiveness\",\"doi\":\"10.1016/j.neo.2022.100818\",\"paper_id\":\"68b67449fc944c707f68e31b629b3909e59b29ea\"},\"P0122\":{\"source_handle\":\"P0122\",\"source_id\":\"source::P0122\",\"aliases\":[],\"title\":\"Microbial Ecosystem Therapeutics 4 (MET4) elicits treatment-specific IgG responses associated with changes in gut microbiota in immune checkpoint inhibitor recipients with advanced solid tumors\",\"doi\":\"10.1136/jitc-2024-010681\",\"paper_id\":\"35e766c4771110cb46b976038e88f19e9daf767b\"},\"P0387\":{\"source_handle\":\"P0387\",\"source_id\":\"source::P0387\",\"aliases\":[],\"title\":\"Immunotherapy with guts: a review of microbial therapeutic adjuncts for immunotherapy in solid tumors\",\"doi\":\"10.1093/oncolo/oyag131\",\"paper_id\":\"a7aa74ce68cc3094e2a185d973f39ba70ae017d9\"},\"P0261\":{\"source_handle\":\"P0261\",\"source_id\":\"source::P0261\",\"aliases\":[],\"title\":\"Facts and Hopes for Gut Microbiota Interventions in Cancer Immunotherapy\",\"doi\":\"10.1158/1078-0432.ccr-21-1129\",\"paper_id\":\"6f9060daa22a7c9efcd4a92919035c5e5c24367a\"},\"P0152\":{\"source_handle\":\"P0152\",\"source_id\":\"source::P0152\",\"aliases\":[],\"title\":\"Natural polysaccharides as immune adjuvants to overcome immune checkpoint inhibitor resistance: mechanistic insights, clinical evidence, and translational challenges\",\"doi\":\"10.3389/fimmu.2026.1914914\",\"paper_id\":\"43db4adf4e2779233c627e8cd307e2c0ac2ad9c1\"},\"P0250\":{\"source_handle\":\"P0250\",\"source_id\":\"source::P0250\",\"aliases\":[],\"title\":\"Exploring the role of the gut microbiome in modulating response to anti-PD-1 immunotherapy in melanoma patients\",\"doi\":\"10.18231/j.ijcbr.2024.033\",\"paper_id\":\"67a11dcbb1430387e3630bb0ffa834eccc29fa4f\"},\"P0212\":{\"source_handle\":\"P0212\",\"source_id\":\"source::P0212\",\"aliases\":[],\"title\":\"Microbiota boost immunotherapy? A meta-analysis dives into fecal microbiota transplantation and immune checkpoint inhibitors\",\"doi\":\"10.1186/s12916-025-04183-y\",\"paper_id\":\"5af3aee4ca5f3778325d44c8432c8b71b95ca531\"},\"P0231\":{\"source_handle\":\"P0231\",\"source_id\":\"source::P0231\",\"aliases\":[],\"title\":\"Potential role of gut microbes in the efficacy and toxicity of immune checkpoints inhibitors\",\"doi\":\"10.3389/fphar.2023.1170591\",\"paper_id\":\"608ca9e37ce71dcbbe9281286a7b96096c05b73c\"},\"P0573\":{\"source_handle\":\"P0573\",\"source_id\":\"source::P0573\",\"aliases\":[],\"title\":\"From chaos to order: optimizing fecal microbiota transplantation for enhanced immune checkpoint inhibitors efficacy\",\"doi\":\"10.1080/19490976.2025.2452277\",\"paper_id\":\"ff51b7d7a956ceb17d4fb9e0f36c3446c6a4cf65\"},\"P0590\":{\"source_handle\":\"P0590\",\"source_id\":\"source::P0590\",\"aliases\":[],\"title\":\"Gut microbiome in colorectal cancer: recent advances and clinical implications\",\"doi\":\"10.3393/ac.2026.00010.0001\",\"paper_id\":\"CorpusId:286044272\"},\"P0417\":{\"source_handle\":\"P0417\",\"source_id\":\"source::P0417\",\"aliases\":[],\"title\":\"Impact of the gut microbiome on immune checkpoint inhibitor efficacy-a systematic review.\",\"doi\":\"10.3747/co.26.5177\",\"paper_id\":\"b6efedbc1ffd0d54c8ed8ce3eb0a38c148e45450\"},\"P0546\":{\"source_handle\":\"P0546\",\"source_id\":\"source::P0546\",\"aliases\":[],\"title\":\"Gut microbiome in modulating immune checkpoint inhibitors\",\"doi\":\"10.1016/j.ebiom.2022.104163\",\"paper_id\":\"f32b23ec68d527d1114ddf96e609079a09947e6e\"},\"P0363\":{\"source_handle\":\"P0363\",\"source_id\":\"source::P0363\",\"aliases\":[],\"title\":\"The gut microbiome–tumor microenvironment axis in immunotherapy response: Mechanistic insights and clinical implications\",\"doi\":\"10.25259/ijmio_8_2026\",\"paper_id\":\"9db1c1ced73dca207c6289b20b4a2914a09ca2b1\"},\"P0329\":{\"source_handle\":\"P0329\",\"source_id\":\"source::P0329\",\"aliases\":[],\"title\":\"Abstract 2727: A designed live bacterial therapeutic restores responder-like microbiome profiles and improves immune checkpoint inhibitor (ICI) response in a predictive model.\",\"doi\":\"10.1158/1538-7445.am2026-2727\",\"paper_id\":\"8c58a2c58d069dea4a7b1ef304fff55a4640d079\"},\"P0357\":{\"source_handle\":\"P0357\",\"sour